    <item>
      <title>Expertise in Automotive Rubber Sealing Solutions</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-aok-oilseal/en/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-aok-oilseal/en/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Commitment to Quality and Innovation in Rubber Seals 
    &lt;div id=&#34;commitment-to-quality-and-innovation-in-rubber-seals&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#commitment-to-quality-and-innovation-in-rubber-seals&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AOK, founded in 1995 and based in Nantou, Taiwan, has established itself as a professional supplier of automotive rubber oil seals. Our expertise centers on the production of valve oil seals and bonding washers, meeting the demands of the automotive industry with precision and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Commitment to Quality and Safety in Oil Seal Manufacturing</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-aok-oilseal/en/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-aok-oilseal/en/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Commitment to Quality and Safety in Oil Seal Manufacturing 
    &lt;div id=&#34;commitment-to-quality-and-safety-in-oil-seal-manufacturing&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#commitment-to-quality-and-safety-in-oil-seal-manufacturing&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AOK Valve Stem Seals, established in 1995 and based in Nantou, Taiwan, is dedicated to the production of high-quality sealing solutions. Our core expertise lies in manufacturing &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.aok-oilseal.com/category-valve-stem-seals.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;valve stem seals&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.aok-oilseal.com/category-bonded-seals.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;bonded seals&lt;/a&gt;, complemented by our capability to deliver custom-engineered rubber-metal parts tailored to specific client needs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
